          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Reading this",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#0b7caf"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The norm is the margin's own mean over the 104 weeks before each week. It is measured as a share, not in cents, because the margin has roughly tripled since 2004.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1a1a1a"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "From 27 Feb 2026 ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1a1a1a",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "MBIE counts a \"fuel market adjustment\" in importer cost and takes it out of the margin (made on 23 Sep 2026 and applied backwards). The ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1a1a1a"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "grey",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#9ca3af",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " line adds it back. It stops on 11 Sep 2026: later weeks arrived already adjusted, and the two cannot be separated.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1a1a1a"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The margin is a residual: the board price minus taxes and an estimate of what replacing the fuel would cost this week. A sharp rise in cost compresses it mechanically. MBIE suspended cost and margin from 18 Mar to 1 Jul 2026 and filled them in later.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1a1a1a"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "A compression marks a cost move that has not reached the pump. It does not say which side closes the gap: in April 2026 cost fell back, in July the pump price rose.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#6b7280"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
